{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/625727-beast-ugallu-everything-knowing-webpage-horror","id":625727,"title":"[Beast] Ugallu - Everything-Knowing-Webpage Horror","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Beast: The Primordial"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-08-13T12:20:57-07:00","id":625727,"title":"[Beast] Ugallu - Everything-Knowing-Webpage Horror","content":"So I'm preparing to run <i>&quot;Morning After&quot;</i> SAS from corebook on our RPG club mini-convetion next weekend. I get character ideas from mine players and one of them proposed something very interesting - but I'm not sure is it possible to run with <b>Beast </b>as a game it is now. Idea is basically this:<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> When Horror is manifesting itself, victim sees herself looking over the Internet and she sees her naked picture with millions of comments, stupid video recorded when drunk, social media posts with weird confessions of her. Finally, she sees live feed like camera was in the picture frame on the table, then like someone stand behind her with video camer, etc. </div> </div> </div>Something like this specific can be made in to Horror from the Nightmares of Exposure?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T13:32:43-07:00","id":625809,"title":"","content":"Huh, it does sound like an Ugallu, but the imagery doesn't seem quite right. Maybe have all these things be displayed on a series of screens and monitors that make up the creature's face/head? Maybe give it the body of a mechanical spider as well, you know, 'cause of the &quot;World Wide Web&quot;?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3514-zealouschristian24","name":"ZealousChristian24","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1796"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T17:32:24-07:00","id":626080,"title":"","content":"Well it's basically a variation of the &quot;I forgot to put clothes on!&quot; nightmare, right? That's something I think the basic nightmare set could use because of how ubiquotous it is. Not one that strips off a subjects actual clothes, but one that leaves them feeling utterly exposed, and even (in the more powerful variations) actively revealing something they meant to conceal. On supernaturals it can strip away human guises.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T22:21:09-07:00","id":626336,"title":"","content":"Hmm sounds more like the lair than the Beast itself. Though I could absolutely see the Beast creating a nightmare that causes the victim to see their secrets on display every time they look at a screen or picture. But yeah a chamber in the lair that's like a hall of web browsers displaying images, gifs, and videos of everything the person wants to forget or conceal just right up and for everyone to see would be pretty good. What kind of Horror is the player considering making?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T22:30:35-07:00","id":626340,"title":"","content":"He was thinking this as the Horror, but maybe &quot;Digital Spider Reflecting Memories&quot; would work better as the Horror itself and &quot;Web Browser History&quot; as Lair's main Chamber, now thinking more about it...<br /> <br /> As to Family, he wanted this being to be Ugallu - like in topics title. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T23:07:28-07:00","id":626355,"title":"","content":"Yeah the description feels more like an environment and a general nightmare that comes from encountering this Horror. The Horror would, to that end, be best served as the thing doing the recording. Otherwise yeah Ugallu are exposure, so this thing making its victims feel like every shameful and embarrassing thing they've done is known would fit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-13T23:12:24-07:00","id":626357,"title":"","content":"Related question - <b>If we go with World Wide Web Spider as Horror, what Atavisms and Nightmares you would advise for this Beast? Maybe even some new ones you could think of?</b>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-08-14T00:45:33-07:00","id":626412,"title":"","content":"Well if your primary feeding method is going to be exposure of secrets then &quot;Needs must&quot; and/or &quot;Eyes of Heaven&quot; are potentially of great use for you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3400-nalak42","name":"nalak42","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3400_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2931"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}